1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:11,573
Every small company has the same unpaid job: someone reads each supplier invoice, checks it against what was agreed, chases the supplier about the difference, and only then pays.

2
00:00:11,523 --> 00:00:16,628
Benchmarks put that at about two weeks and ten dollars of work per invoice.

3
00:00:16,628 --> 00:00:18,497
This is Kassa.

4
00:00:18,497 --> 00:00:21,471
It does that job, on PayPal.

